<title>FRANCE: Alcatel plans buyout of Thomson-CSF minorities.</title>
<headline>Alcatel plans buyout of Thomson-CSF minorities.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom said on Wednesday it planned to offer to buy out minority stakeholders in the Thomson-CSF affiliate of Thomson SA as part of its offer to acquire Thomson from the French government.</p>
</text>
